<h2>Us</h2>
<img src="https://source.unsplash.com/featured/?couple,phone">

<p>
You came into my life quietly and changed it without trying.  
We didn’t need grand moments to feel close, just simple talks.  
Even with oceans between us, you feel part of my everyday routine.  
Those nights we fall asleep on call feel more real than anything.  
Sometimes we talk, sometimes we just exist in silence.  
I learned that love doesn’t need touch to grow.  
It grows in patience, in waiting, in staying.  
You became my calm place in a noisy world.  
Distance is just a situation, not our story.  
What we built feels safe and real.
</p>
